(1240239, 158009, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice bokeh. Composition-wise, I think that cropping the left side and leaving more empty space on the right would create an illusion of looking into the distance. But I like it this way, too.</td>', 'Very nice bokeh. Composition-wise, I think that cropping the left side and leaving more empty space on the right would create an illusion of looking into the distance. But I like it this way, too.', '2005-03-21 04:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
