(1240724, 157886, 4226, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but too many unwanted reflections. For this kind of photography, try to take the shot in a dark room, and then lighten up the background so that there is no reflection on the subject .. no doors/windows or the photographer itself should be seen in the reflection. You can see the ''bulb'' shot in my profile which is done that way...</td>', 'Good idea, but too many unwanted reflections. For this kind of photography, try to take the shot in a dark room, and then lighten up the background so that there is no reflection on the subject .. no doors/windows or the photographer itself should be seen in the reflection. You can see the ''bulb'' shot in my profile which is done that way...', '2005-03-21 11:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
