(1240909, 158063, 24454, '<td valign="top">WOW!   Absolutely beautiful!!   I wonder if you are hearing that your building looks a little tilted.  I only say that because I submitted one sort of like this once  that seemed to be slightly tilted, and got dinged a lot for it.   I hope you don''t because this is truly a gorgeous picture!</td>', 'WOW!   Absolutely beautiful!!   I wonder if you are hearing that your building looks a little tilted.  I only say that because I submitted one sort of like this once  that seemed to be slightly tilted, and got dinged a lot for it.   I hope you don''t because this is truly a gorgeous picture!', '2005-03-21 12:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1240911, 158198, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2005-03-21 12:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1240912, 158135, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is  a really nice idea with some beautiful colours, but there are 4 lines streaknig down through the image that area  bit distracting. Another suggestion, try to take an image with something strong in the foreground. Flat on, there''s nothing of interest to move your eye into the photograph. Maybe a flower right up near your lens with those other flowers in behind would add a bit of interest. Try thinking of your canvas as divided into 3s (horizontally and vertically) and then try adding something strong in one of those nine sections.</td>', 'This is  a really nice idea with some beautiful colours, but there are 4 lines streaknig down through the image that area  bit distracting. Another suggestion, try to take an image with something strong in the foreground. Flat on, there''s nothing of interest to move your eye into the photograph. Maybe a flower right up near your lens with those other flowers in behind would add a bit of interest. Try thinking of your canvas as divided into 3s (horizontally and vertically) and then try adding something strong in one of those nine sections.', '2005-03-21 12:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1240915, 157975, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2005-03-21 12:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
