(1240922, 158131, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a neat picture.  The black background makes a subjec that may not normally seem that interesting look really cool.   And the water drops really add to it!   Good luck.</td>', 'This is a neat picture.  The black background makes a subjec that may not normally seem that interesting look really cool.   And the water drops really add to it!   Good luck.', '2005-03-21 12:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
