(1241166, 156837, 21216, '<td valign="top">It''s for a car commercial right? :D <br/> <br/>Fabulous entry with a fabulous lighting set up. Love the details on the lips and the focus as well though I must the nose and the teeth are a little bit distracting, but I wouldn''t want to change the angle just to get rid of the nose and if the mouth was cloed it wouldn''t have been this sexual. SO I pretty much think this is a perfect exemple of stock photography, and if I was a member (It''s not my fault) I would have certainly given this a 9</td>', 'It''s for a car commercial right? :D  Fabulous entry with a fabulous lighting set up. Love the details on the lips and the focus as well though I must the nose and the teeth are a little bit distracting, but I wouldn''t want to change the angle just to get rid of the nose and if the mouth was cloed it wouldn''t have been this sexual. SO I pretty much think this is a perfect exemple of stock photography, and if I was a member (It''s not my fault) I would have certainly given this a 9', '2005-03-21 14:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
