(1241187, 157880, 31213, '<td valign="top">I dont know if this image would sell as a stock shot.  The picture is gorgeous....love the colors and composition....but I don''t know what kind of ad agency would pick this up.  Maybe somthing for Spring......or nature......or something toward "vibrancy".  I dunno.  I guess its just kind of a reach for a successfull stock.....not very versitile.  Still like the image though.  Goodluck!</td>', 'I dont know if this image would sell as a stock shot.  The picture is gorgeous....love the colors and composition....but I don''t know what kind of ad agency would pick this up.  Maybe somthing for Spring......or nature......or something toward "vibrancy".  I dunno.  I guess its just kind of a reach for a successfull stock.....not very versitile.  Still like the image though.  Goodluck!', '2005-03-21 14:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
