(1241223, 156133, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice stock shot!  I wish a couple small things were different though.....<br/> <br/>#1. A consistent floor under the dog would''ve been better because it would''nt distract us from the subject.<br/> <br/>#2. I wish you had pulled this into photoshop and gone to "Image -&gt; adjustments -&gt;  auto color"  This would have taken the orange haze off your picture and the color would ahve been more true.  Try it now (even after the fact) just to see what I mean.  Hope this helps.  Nice job.....goodluck!  7<br/> <br/>Chris</td>', 'Nice stock shot!  I wish a couple small things were different though..... #1. A consistent floor under the dog would''ve been better because it would''nt distract us from the subject. #2. I wish you had pulled this into photoshop and gone to "Image -> adjustments ->  auto color"  This would have taken the orange haze off your picture and the color would ahve been more true.  Try it now (even after the fact) just to see what I mean.  Hope this helps.  Nice job.....goodluck!  7 Chris', '2005-03-21 14:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
