(1241317, 158164, 29816, '<td valign="top">The letters at the top are just a little fuzzy. Focus maybe, or a more stable mount on a long exposure.</td>', 'The letters at the top are just a little fuzzy. Focus maybe, or a more stable mount on a long exposure.', '2005-03-21 15:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
