(1241331, 158194, 29816, '<td valign="top">Great color, great lighting - I just feel you cropped it too low...</td>', 'Great color, great lighting - I just feel you cropped it too low...', '2005-03-21 16:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241335, 158045, 32792, '<td valign="top">Loved the way u stacked the glasses and used the background to give a "mirror" effect!<br/>Cleverly done!</td>', 'Loved the way u stacked the glasses and used the background to give a "mirror" effect!Cleverly done!', '2005-03-21 16:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241340, 156032, 32792, '<td valign="top">The waves are dramatic, the sky is dramatic! The surfer jumping like that!<br/>Put it all together and u get a great image, just like yours! OUTSTANDING!</td>', 'The waves are dramatic, the sky is dramatic! The surfer jumping like that!Put it all together and u get a great image, just like yours! OUTSTANDING!', '2005-03-21 16:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241344, 158075, 32792, '<td valign="top">I could just sit at this very same spot at look at this for the whole day!<br/>Unique take on the theme! Great job!</td>', 'I could just sit at this very same spot at look at this for the whole day!Unique take on the theme! Great job!', '2005-03-21 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241361, 157612, 18367, '<td valign="top">I was looking for an image that I found interesting and that would appeal to the consumer side in me..... and this is definitely one.  A truly beautiful photograph that reminds me of when my daughter was much younger and I used to read her bedtime stories.<br/> <br/>There are a few shadows which I find a bit distracting, but certainly not enough to merit any severe adjustment in my score.  This is so far an 8, and I will be back to revisit this photo before final tabulations are in.  Great work.</td>', 'I was looking for an image that I found interesting and that would appeal to the consumer side in me..... and this is definitely one.  A truly beautiful photograph that reminds me of when my daughter was much younger and I used to read her bedtime stories. There are a few shadows which I find a bit distracting, but certainly not enough to merit any severe adjustment in my score.  This is so far an 8, and I will be back to revisit this photo before final tabulations are in.  Great work.', '2005-03-21 16:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241364, 156635, 31742, '<td valign="top">Love the blue  in this pic .. really good work ant</td>', 'Love the blue  in this pic .. really good work ant', '2005-03-21 16:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241370, 158135, 12750, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell whats going on. Small pic especially at my resolution. Sharpness would help.</td>', 'Hard to tell whats going on. Small pic especially at my resolution. Sharpness would help.', '2005-03-21 16:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241385, 157262, 18367, '<td valign="top">This would make a great ad.... I really like it. It is simple yes so effective at conveying the message.  I have placed this in my upper scale scoring bracket and will come back to revisit it prior to final tabulations.  <br/> <br/>Great job... keep up the good work.</td>', 'This would make a great ad.... I really like it. It is simple yes so effective at conveying the message.  I have placed this in my upper scale scoring bracket and will come back to revisit it prior to final tabulations.   Great job... keep up the good work.', '2005-03-21 16:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241389, 158098, 34217, '<td valign="top">I am not a big fan of selective color and I think you color is to saturated, but  I really like your concept.</td>', 'I am not a big fan of selective color and I think you color is to saturated, but  I really like your concept.', '2005-03-21 16:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241393, 157176, 34217, '<td valign="top">It looks like you did a little to much to the color in PS.  A poor sunset cannot be fixed to look better in photoshop, however, on camera filters can help.  You should give them a try.  Also your composition could be helped by not placing the horizon in the middle of your shot. Put it at the 1/3 marks</td>', 'It looks like you did a little to much to the color in PS.  A poor sunset cannot be fixed to look better in photoshop, however, on camera filters can help.  You should give them a try.  Also your composition could be helped by not placing the horizon in the middle of your shot. Put it at the 1/3 marks', '2005-03-21 16:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241396, 157660, 33560, '<td valign="top">With cut glass onwe expects a kind of crysalline sharpmess of focus which is absent here.</td>', 'With cut glass onwe expects a kind of crysalline sharpmess of focus which is absent here.', '2005-03-21 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241397, 158072, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great bokeh.</td>', 'Nice composition, great bokeh.', '2005-03-21 16:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241402, 157727, 34217, '<td valign="top">your angle is boring.  Try doing some really different angles like looking down the strings or crop in really tight.  Violins are very interesting if shot correctly.</td>', 'your angle is boring.  Try doing some really different angles like looking down the strings or crop in really tight.  Violins are very interesting if shot correctly.', '2005-03-21 16:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241404, 158049, 34217, '<td valign="top">I wish the quality of your file was better, but good capture</td>', 'I wish the quality of your file was better, but good capture', '2005-03-21 16:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241409, 156284, 33560, '<td valign="top">Good model, strong lighting, nice pose.</td>', 'Good model, strong lighting, nice pose.', '2005-03-21 16:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241412, 158071, 34217, '<td valign="top">good concept, but you needed to add more enviroment to the shot.  Maybe a wood table instead of white, with soft morning light coming in and some coffee.  or something that has to do with reading and your light is too flat</td>', 'good concept, but you needed to add more enviroment to the shot.  Maybe a wood table instead of white, with soft morning light coming in and some coffee.  or something that has to do with reading and your light is too flat', '2005-03-21 16:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241413, 157877, 34217, '<td valign="top">pretty</td>', 'pretty', '2005-03-21 16:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241415, 157597, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the spiral and the fact that it''s set at an angle across the photo.  I find the cerise colored whatsit in the background to dominate even though it is out of focus.</td>', 'I love the spiral and the fact that it''s set at an angle across the photo.  I find the cerise colored whatsit in the background to dominate even though it is out of focus.', '2005-03-21 16:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241416, 156608, 34217, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I do think you need a small point of contact shadow so she does not look like she is floating on white</td>', 'Nice shot.  I do think you need a small point of contact shadow so she does not look like she is floating on white', '2005-03-21 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241417, 157600, 34217, '<td valign="top">Your light is too flat.  Try moving you light sorce 45 degrees to the side and it looks like she is flipping off the camera, which would be ok if her facial expression matched the gesture.</td>', 'Your light is too flat.  Try moving you light sorce 45 degrees to the side and it looks like she is flipping off the camera, which would be ok if her facial expression matched the gesture.', '2005-03-21 16:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241420, 157868, 33560, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the color.  It think the cap could benefit from stronger fill  lighting from about 45-60 deg from the viewing angle.  I find the composiion to be a little static.</td>', 'Not fond of the color.  It think the cap could benefit from stronger fill  lighting from about 45-60 deg from the viewing angle.  I find the composiion to be a little static.', '2005-03-21 16:50:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1241421, 158196, 34217, '<td valign="top">good idea, nice crop, boring light and too hot on the fingers.  try lighting a little above next time.  Again everthing else is great</td>', 'good idea, nice crop, boring light and too hot on the fingers.  try lighting a little above next time.  Again everthing else is great', '2005-03-21 16:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241424, 157895, 34217, '<td valign="top">great idea.  I feel like having the four, one in each corner is a bit symetrical for me and I would have like to see the color pop a little more, but still well done.</td>', 'great idea.  I feel like having the four, one in each corner is a bit symetrical for me and I would have like to see the color pop a little more, but still well done.', '2005-03-21 16:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241429, 158081, 34217, '<td valign="top">what is it?</td>', 'what is it?', '2005-03-21 16:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241430, 158097, 24976, '<td valign="top">i wish the quality of the image was higher...</td>', 'i wish the quality of the image was higher...', '2005-03-21 16:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241431, 157458, 34217, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-03-21 16:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241432, 156427, 33560, '<td valign="top">I''m a little grossed out by the froth on the tongue and by the wierdness of its shape, texture and color.  Somehow, despite the prominence and sharp focus on the eyes and tools, the tongue upstages them all,  And that, for me, ruins a potentially very good photo. Just my reaction.</td>', 'I''m a little grossed out by the froth on the tongue and by the wierdness of its shape, texture and color.  Somehow, despite the prominence and sharp focus on the eyes and tools, the tongue upstages them all,  And that, for me, ruins a potentially very good photo. Just my reaction.', '2005-03-21 16:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241435, 157658, 34217, '<td valign="top">boring light, it is too flat, you need some drama in your lighting and your color is washed out</td>', 'boring light, it is too flat, you need some drama in your lighting and your color is washed out', '2005-03-21 16:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241436, 157240, 34217, '<td valign="top">good job!  Great lighting, I love the little bit of softness, your styling is really great, well done!</td>', 'good job!  Great lighting, I love the little bit of softness, your styling is really great, well done!', '2005-03-21 16:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241439, 158131, 33560, '<td valign="top">A very strong photo; good composition, nice texture and lighting. I wish the shadows on the pears did not so quickly fade to black, even understandint that this was done on purpose to remove the surface on which they sat.</td>', 'A very strong photo; good composition, nice texture and lighting. I wish the shadows on the pears did not so quickly fade to black, even understandint that this was done on purpose to remove the surface on which they sat.', '2005-03-21 16:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241440, 157948, 34217, '<td valign="top">your lighting is really boring, were you using on carmera flash?  Try using a tripod with no flash</td>', 'your lighting is really boring, were you using on carmera flash?  Try using a tripod with no flash', '2005-03-21 16:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241441, 158073, 33435, '<td valign="top">The top 3 flowers are nice, but I would have cropped a little off the left side, and cut the right side where the third flower ends.  It would have made a big difference in the photo for me. 5</td>', 'The top 3 flowers are nice, but I would have cropped a little off the left side, and cut the right side where the third flower ends.  It would have made a big difference in the photo for me. 5', '2005-03-21 16:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241443, 156124, 24976, '<td valign="top">its a decent stock image but seems to have been processed too much in terms of sharpening, noise removal and blurring, also some of the burning/dodging as well. All these things are not bad things by any means but they havent been executed well in this image.</td>', 'its a decent stock image but seems to have been processed too much in terms of sharpening, noise removal and blurring, also some of the burning/dodging as well. All these things are not bad things by any means but they havent been executed well in this image.', '2005-03-21 16:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241444, 157444, 34217, '<td valign="top">it looks under exposed.  In order to make this more interesting I would have like the see you crop in to only get part of the lemon with the black on the oppisite side and I would like to see the yellow color really pop, the color is dead right now.</td>', 'it looks under exposed.  In order to make this more interesting I would have like the see you crop in to only get part of the lemon with the black on the oppisite side and I would like to see the yellow color really pop, the color is dead right now.', '2005-03-21 16:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241445, 157510, 34192, '<td valign="top">Only 10 I can find so far.  Beautiful shot. Wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Only 10 I can find so far.  Beautiful shot. Wouldn''t change a thing.', '2005-03-21 16:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241447, 158072, 34217, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2005-03-21 17:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241448, 156876, 33560, '<td valign="top">If I were served a bowl of veggies that looked exactly like this, I''d have to have not had a thing to eat for a week to get to the bottom of it, or even to take the first bite; so for me the photo is ironically titled. It''s nicely lit and composed, but for reasons already explained, leaves me cold.  For me the magic of food photos is either to look delicious or to capture the color and form of the vegetable in a more abstract way, and to me this does neither.</td>', 'If I were served a bowl of veggies that looked exactly like this, I''d have to have not had a thing to eat for a week to get to the bottom of it, or even to take the first bite; so for me the photo is ironically titled. It''s nicely lit and composed, but for reasons already explained, leaves me cold.  For me the magic of food photos is either to look delicious or to capture the color and form of the vegetable in a more abstract way, and to me this does neither.', '2005-03-21 17:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241449, 157661, 34217, '<td valign="top">I would like to see less black just crop a bit of the bottom off so it is not so centered.</td>', 'I would like to see less black just crop a bit of the bottom off so it is not so centered.', '2005-03-21 17:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241451, 156803, 34217, '<td valign="top">very cool, 10</td>', 'very cool, 10', '2005-03-21 17:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241452, 157378, 34217, '<td valign="top">so cute!</td>', 'so cute!', '2005-03-21 17:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241453, 157618, 33726, '<td valign="top">beautiful colour in the sky and great diagonal flow</td>', 'beautiful colour in the sky and great diagonal flow', '2005-03-21 17:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241454, 157179, 34192, '<td valign="top">wow.  That is just a cool image. Excellent capture.  And the greens are separated nicely.  8 will pass again. It reminds me of "Antz."</td>', 'wow.  That is just a cool image. Excellent capture.  And the greens are separated nicely.  8 will pass again. It reminds me of "Antz."', '2005-03-21 17:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241457, 157375, 34217, '<td valign="top">it does not look very sharp</td>', 'it does not look very sharp', '2005-03-21 17:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241458, 156840, 24976, '<td valign="top">amazing capture especially were the orange meets the blue.... the branch in the foreground is kinda wierdly edited, there is a part that almost has a yellow and purplish hue to it. but anyways when i cover the bottom half of the image its a perfect shot imo. 9</td>', 'amazing capture especially were the orange meets the blue.... the branch in the foreground is kinda wierdly edited, there is a part that almost has a yellow and purplish hue to it. but anyways when i cover the bottom half of the image its a perfect shot imo. 9', '2005-03-21 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241459, 157240, 33560, '<td valign="top">''What''s on your tortilla?''  I love the colors and textures. Good lighting.  I love the fact that these items go together culinarily:  really nice choice to include lime and cilantro.  Also, I like that this is not something we see every day.  Very nice.</td>', '''What''s on your tortilla?''  I love the colors and textures. Good lighting.  I love the fact that these items go together culinarily:  really nice choice to include lime and cilantro.  Also, I like that this is not something we see every day.  Very nice.', '2005-03-21 17:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241461, 157887, 34217, '<td valign="top">your composition is too centered  your horizon should fall on a 1/3 mark.</td>', 'your composition is too centered  your horizon should fall on a 1/3 mark.', '2005-03-21 17:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241462, 156837, 33726, '<td valign="top">i''d like to see a little less shadow in the upper lip it would make a much stronger focal point   great shot for composure and dof  the title is appropriate too!</td>', 'i''d like to see a little less shadow in the upper lip it would make a much stronger focal point   great shot for composure and dof  the title is appropriate too!', '2005-03-21 17:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241463, 158123, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great lighing, great expression. Very Nice.</td>', 'Great lighing, great expression. Very Nice.', '2005-03-21 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241464, 158191, 24976, '<td valign="top">this is being really picky, but you should have used a newer ball...</td>', 'this is being really picky, but you should have used a newer ball...', '2005-03-21 17:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241467, 158074, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great twist on a hackneyed stock photo topic.</td>', 'Great twist on a hackneyed stock photo topic.', '2005-03-21 17:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241472, 157213, 24976, '<td valign="top">Despite being somewhat of a cliche image... this is awesome!!! the colors are prefect, the composition is perfect, and the capture is spot on. a 10 from me.</td>', 'Despite being somewhat of a cliche image... this is awesome!!! the colors are prefect, the composition is perfect, and the capture is spot on. a 10 from me.', '2005-03-21 17:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241476, 157855, 33560, '<td valign="top">Call me a curmudgeon, but to me the flower ruins the photo. 1)  This particular shade of pinkish mauve clashes with the creamy avocado theme color IMO 2)  It''s out of focus petals block  the shiny metal to which our eyes are naturally drawn. So we resent it''s presence doubly.  Oherwise I think the photo is a good take on the titled theme.</td>', 'Call me a curmudgeon, but to me the flower ruins the photo. 1)  This particular shade of pinkish mauve clashes with the creamy avocado theme color IMO 2)  It''s out of focus petals block  the shiny metal to which our eyes are naturally drawn. So we resent it''s presence doubly.  Oherwise I think the photo is a good take on the titled theme.', '2005-03-21 17:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241481, 157172, 33726, '<td valign="top">how about WOW for a first impression. i love it. the only thing i''d do differently is use a glass with less defects.</td>', 'how about WOW for a first impression. i love it. the only thing i''d do differently is use a glass with less defects.', '2005-03-21 17:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241483, 158085, 33560, '<td valign="top">I find the composition a little static and the lighting uninteresting - being from behind it leaves everything flat. The gull is interesting, but I find it distracting that the horizon passes right through his abdomen.</td>', 'I find the composition a little static and the lighting uninteresting - being from behind it leaves everything flat. The gull is interesting, but I find it distracting that the horizon passes right through his abdomen.', '2005-03-21 17:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241484, 157584, 3569, '<td valign="top">Very David Muench like, beautiful</td>', 'Very David Muench like, beautiful', '2005-03-21 17:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241485, 157619, 33726, '<td valign="top">i surf so i had to say "what''s up". great action shot.</td>', 'i surf so i had to say "what''s up". great action shot.', '2005-03-21 17:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241488, 157397, 33560, '<td valign="top">How rarely we get humor in a duck shot, yet this shot has it.  How rarely we get to enjoy the blue, green, orange and yellow colors of the duck all arranged in the most flattering array. ( in terms of color palette), yet this shot has it.  It''s crisp, perfectly lit, great bokeh.  Really nice shot.</td>', 'How rarely we get humor in a duck shot, yet this shot has it.  How rarely we get to enjoy the blue, green, orange and yellow colors of the duck all arranged in the most flattering array. ( in terms of color palette), yet this shot has it.  It''s crisp, perfectly lit, great bokeh.  Really nice shot.', '2005-03-21 17:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241489, 158119, 33726, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. i''d crop the bottom though for balance.</td>', 'beautiful shot. i''d crop the bottom though for balance.', '2005-03-21 17:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241490, 157026, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost. The light around the bud itself, and the effect on the water, is fine - in the area of the stem and the leaves it becomes evident that is very direct, and quite harsh. The cropping out of the lower leaves seems entirely arbitrary.</td>', 'Almost. The light around the bud itself, and the effect on the water, is fine - in the area of the stem and the leaves it becomes evident that is very direct, and quite harsh. The cropping out of the lower leaves seems entirely arbitrary.', '2005-03-21 17:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241491, 158149, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the brighly colored kite and the way it sort of fits into the corner of the photo.</td>', 'I love the brighly colored kite and the way it sort of fits into the corner of the photo.', '2005-03-21 17:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241493, 157331, 6999, '<td valign="top">I can see it having a market, for sure. I have an issue with the non-horizontal, especially for this challenge, and overall the composition seems rather complex for a strong selling image. Good sense of history though, and that would certainly serve.</td>', 'I can see it having a market, for sure. I have an issue with the non-horizontal, especially for this challenge, and overall the composition seems rather complex for a strong selling image. Good sense of history though, and that would certainly serve.', '2005-03-21 17:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241496, 157860, 6999, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t quite accept this into my putative agency - the dark and uneven background, the sideways coin reallly doesn''t help, and the pig seems brighter than the rest of the image. I couldn''t imagine it selling, especially as it''s <i>such</i> a cliche of an image. Focus etc. is all OK, but it lacks impact overall.</td>', 'I wouldn''t quite accept this into my putative agency - the dark and uneven background, the sideways coin reallly doesn''t help, and the pig seems brighter than the rest of the image. I couldn''t imagine it selling, especially as it''s such a cliche of an image. Focus etc. is all OK, but it lacks impact overall.', '2005-03-21 17:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241498, 157969, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like the woodwork, the black robes and the red cylinder.  The funny primitive rite being depicted clutters the photo.</td>', 'I like the woodwork, the black robes and the red cylinder.  The funny primitive rite being depicted clutters the photo.', '2005-03-21 17:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241499, 157975, 34217, '<td valign="top">i wish you color was more saturated</td>', 'i wish you color was more saturated', '2005-03-21 17:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241500, 158044, 33560, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2005-03-21 17:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241502, 157458, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2005-03-21 17:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241505, 157359, 33560, '<td valign="top">Green and red light just not doing it for me.  The arrangement in the center feels cluttered and haphazard, though I think the lighting may be partly to blame.</td>', 'Green and red light just not doing it for me.  The arrangement in the center feels cluttered and haphazard, though I think the lighting may be partly to blame.', '2005-03-21 17:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241506, 158132, 6999, '<td valign="top">As an illustrative idea this is quite strong, but I can''t imagine any client wanting it without cropping - surely, the bucket is the subject here, more than the tree? The fade-out of the background is useful, i think - allowing text to show over it, if wanted. I wonder if a little more drama in the light wouldn''t go amiss?</td>', 'As an illustrative idea this is quite strong, but I can''t imagine any client wanting it without cropping - surely, the bucket is the subject here, more than the tree? The fade-out of the background is useful, i think - allowing text to show over it, if wanted. I wonder if a little more drama in the light wouldn''t go amiss?', '2005-03-21 17:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241508, 158132, 34217, '<td valign="top">I have seen almost this exact picture with the same titled on the website</td>', 'I have seen almost this exact picture with the same titled on the website', '2005-03-21 17:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241510, 157617, 34217, '<td valign="top">I would have like to see it cropped tighter</td>', 'I would have like to see it cropped tighter', '2005-03-21 17:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241511, 158075, 34217, '<td valign="top">WOW!! 10</td>', 'WOW!! 10', '2005-03-21 17:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241512, 158125, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a  strong image.  The bokeh is impactful, but I think a little too much of the subject is out of focus.  And I am bothered by the blown highlights, though I imagine they are just about inevitable.</td>', 'It''s a  strong image.  The bokeh is impactful, but I think a little too much of the subject is out of focus.  And I am bothered by the blown highlights, though I imagine they are just about inevitable.', '2005-03-21 17:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241515, 158065, 24976, '<td valign="top">really cute and funny shot. a favourite and a 10 from me :-) best of luck</td>', 'really cute and funny shot. a favourite and a 10 from me :-) best of luck', '2005-03-21 17:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241517, 158135, 34217, '<td valign="top">poor quality, what happened?</td>', 'poor quality, what happened?', '2005-03-21 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241519, 157593, 6999, '<td valign="top">Can certainly see a use for it, and the game''s in the news worldwide right now. I think I would have wanted you to include the whole shadow, or at least not crop so close to it. I like that it''s used, also.</td>', 'Can certainly see a use for it, and the game''s in the news worldwide right now. I think I would have wanted you to include the whole shadow, or at least not crop so close to it. I like that it''s used, also.', '2005-03-21 17:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241520, 157938, 34217, '<td valign="top">I love everything, but the branch in fron of the bird.  the color is beautiful the composition is great, but that damn branch is so distracting.</td>', 'I love everything, but the branch in fron of the bird.  the color is beautiful the composition is great, but that damn branch is so distracting.', '2005-03-21 17:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241524, 158070, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the teapot and the butterfly.  The lighting is good to the extent it is not overpowering. Is it possible to have blown highlights with saturated colors?  I think he answer might be yes, and I think this might offer an example; Certainly it looks like there is a loss of detail in both yellow and violet flowers.   I know they are beginning to be used together frequently, but I''m not fond of violet with strong yellows.</td>', 'I love the teapot and the butterfly.  The lighting is good to the extent it is not overpowering. Is it possible to have blown highlights with saturated colors?  I think he answer might be yes, and I think this might offer an example; Certainly it looks like there is a loss of detail in both yellow and violet flowers.   I know they are beginning to be used together frequently, but I''m not fond of violet with strong yellows.', '2005-03-21 17:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241525, 158176, 33560, '<td valign="top">A beautifully lit and photographed sculpure.</td>', 'A beautifully lit and photographed sculpure.', '2005-03-21 17:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241526, 158164, 30608, '<td valign="top">This caught my eye the first pass thru of my voting process. Execellent lighting, and your sharpness is dead on. Can''t help but wonder if this would have looked better on a white background. Good Luck!  8</td>', 'This caught my eye the first pass thru of my voting process. Execellent lighting, and your sharpness is dead on. Can''t help but wonder if this would have looked better on a white background. Good Luck!  8', '2005-03-21 17:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241529, 156837, 34217, '<td valign="top">very pretty.  Than angle makes her fingers look kinda big, however it is so lovely that I will not score down 10</td>', 'very pretty.  Than angle makes her fingers look kinda big, however it is so lovely that I will not score down 10', '2005-03-21 17:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241536, 157354, 33560, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very solid photo of a very beautiful space.  <br/> <br/>If this photo underperforms it will be partly because we teach ourselves at this site to see in pictures of 640 pixels.  Photos with lots of detail - ones that offer up strong images of extended and detailed spaces - often tend to be underrated. Some of this is justified by the limits of the medium. But sometimes I think it goes too far.</td>', 'I think this is a very solid photo of a very beautiful space.   If this photo underperforms it will be partly because we teach ourselves at this site to see in pictures of 640 pixels.  Photos with lots of detail - ones that offer up strong images of extended and detailed spaces - often tend to be underrated. Some of this is justified by the limits of the medium. But sometimes I think it goes too far.', '2005-03-21 17:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241542, 158052, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the strong bokeh of the background, but I find the shallow DOF has rendered all but an area of about 50x50 pixels out of focus.  I''d love to see much more of the foreground sharply.</td>', 'I love the strong bokeh of the background, but I find the shallow DOF has rendered all but an area of about 50x50 pixels out of focus.  I''d love to see much more of the foreground sharply.', '2005-03-21 17:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241548, 157617, 33560, '<td valign="top">I start out seeing the background.  I think ''no problem, I''ll just look at the bit that''s in focus.''  Then I look some more.  ''Aha,''  I think, ''the subject blade of grass is in focus.''   But it''s not.  ''Then that tiny little drop in the center of the picture is in focus, surely.''   But it''s not.   Then I start to wish the photographer had just let the drop fall and gotten everything out of focus.</td>', 'I start out seeing the background.  I think ''no problem, I''ll just look at the bit that''s in focus.''  Then I look some more.  ''Aha,''  I think, ''the subject blade of grass is in focus.''   But it''s not.  ''Then that tiny little drop in the center of the picture is in focus, surely.''   But it''s not.   Then I start to wish the photographer had just let the drop fall and gotten everything out of focus.', '2005-03-21 17:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241550, 158042, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nicely observed.</td>', 'Nicely observed.', '2005-03-21 17:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241553, 157242, 33560, '<td valign="top">Crisp focus.  Nice composition.  A fortuitous accident tha tthe color and texture of the metal screens manage to match those of the subject?  The color of the background is ideal and so is the dodging.  Credit to the photographer for taking great advantage of the advanced editing rules.  Very Nice</td>', 'Crisp focus.  Nice composition.  A fortuitous accident tha tthe color and texture of the metal screens manage to match those of the subject?  The color of the background is ideal and so is the dodging.  Credit to the photographer for taking great advantage of the advanced editing rules.  Very Nice', '2005-03-21 17:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241566, 156732, 33560, '<td valign="top">The pine cone posesses a primal attraction whose explanation has eluded anthropologists and psychologists for centuries. I''m afraid that the harsh lighting has made this viewing angle pretty much impossible for  a good shot, since the brighness of the sky and the shadow in the cone are too far apart to be captured by a digital camera without some careful auxilliary lighting.<br/> <br/>I like the mathematical shape of the cone, its placement on a rule of thirds vertex, and the trifold symmetry of the twigs that radiate from it.   I find the subject to be a little to small and too hard to see.</td>', 'The pine cone posesses a primal attraction whose explanation has eluded anthropologists and psychologists for centuries. I''m afraid that the harsh lighting has made this viewing angle pretty much impossible for  a good shot, since the brighness of the sky and the shadow in the cone are too far apart to be captured by a digital camera without some careful auxilliary lighting. I like the mathematical shape of the cone, its placement on a rule of thirds vertex, and the trifold symmetry of the twigs that radiate from it.   I find the subject to be a little to small and too hard to see.', '2005-03-21 18:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241571, 157500, 33560, '<td valign="top">All I can think is ''Mr Ed.''  In the case of this photo, it might be subtitled, ''The barn with ears.''  I like the low angle and the expression on the horse''s face.  I also like the barn, but I don''t like the roofline passing through his ears. I also find the 1/4 door below his mouth distracting.</td>', 'All I can think is ''Mr Ed.''  In the case of this photo, it might be subtitled, ''The barn with ears.''  I like the low angle and the expression on the horse''s face.  I also like the barn, but I don''t like the roofline passing through his ears. I also find the 1/4 door below his mouth distracting.', '2005-03-21 18:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241573, 156686, 31307, '<td valign="top">"Angles"  Dp you mean "Angels?"  Cool shot anyway.  I''m an air and water (mainly sails)  fan all the way.</td>', '"Angles"  Dp you mean "Angels?"  Cool shot anyway.  I''m an air and water (mainly sails)  fan all the way.', '2005-03-21 18:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241577, 156840, 31637, '<td valign="top">awesome</td>', 'awesome', '2005-03-21 18:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241581, 158158, 31637, '<td valign="top">I dont think I ever rated a floral this high    ....nice image</td>', 'I dont think I ever rated a floral this high    ....nice image', '2005-03-21 18:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241582, 157213, 31637, '<td valign="top">amazing capture</td>', 'amazing capture', '2005-03-21 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241583, 158159, 33560, '<td valign="top">I think this a  remarkable photo.  The colors are gorgeous.  The line is strong.  There is good variation in texture which leads you through the photo.  In a perfect world (and these are but the merest trifling quibbles)  I could imagine the subject more toward the left of the photo, balancing the tall column and the bag he has brought to be out of the photo entirely.</td>', 'I think this a  remarkable photo.  The colors are gorgeous.  The line is strong.  There is good variation in texture which leads you through the photo.  In a perfect world (and these are but the merest trifling quibbles)  I could imagine the subject more toward the left of the photo, balancing the tall column and the bag he has brought to be out of the photo entirely.', '2005-03-21 18:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241585, 157949, 31637, '<td valign="top">bottom right seems fuzzy.  nice selective focus if it was intended.</td>', 'bottom right seems fuzzy.  nice selective focus if it was intended.', '2005-03-21 18:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
