(1241590, 156032, 31307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Even my brother (who surfs but is not an "art" guy) would love this.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Even my brother (who surfs but is not an "art" guy) would love this.', '2005-03-21 18:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
