(1241607, 158063, 31637, '<td valign="top">faboulous composition. The Chrysler building looks mint, very sharp and well lit.</td>', 'faboulous composition. The Chrysler building looks mint, very sharp and well lit.', '2005-03-21 18:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241608, 158132, 33560, '<td valign="top">The location of the collection can seems too near the center of the photo.   I am used to seeing trees of this proportional size (wrt the photo)  set off to the side and used as framing elements.  I thinkd the disparate elements of the photo have potential that is untapped by this photo.</td>', 'The location of the collection can seems too near the center of the photo.   I am used to seeing trees of this proportional size (wrt the photo)  set off to the side and used as framing elements.  I thinkd the disparate elements of the photo have potential that is untapped by this photo.', '2005-03-21 18:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241610, 157879, 7599, '<td valign="top">Your focus is excellent as is the detail. I just don''t really feel that this image would hold my interest for very long.</td>', 'Your focus is excellent as is the detail. I just don''t really feel that this image would hold my interest for very long.', '2005-03-21 18:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241612, 157009, 18834, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Im going to guess it was done using the barn door technique.  If i am correct, I recommend that next time, have the top half of the keyboard the side folded becaus then you will not see the screen on the top left.</td>', 'I like this shot.  Im going to guess it was done using the barn door technique.  If i am correct, I recommend that next time, have the top half of the keyboard the side folded becaus then you will not see the screen on the top left.', '2005-03-21 18:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241613, 158049, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great action shot</td>', 'Great action shot', '2005-03-21 18:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241614, 156171, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love it.</td>', 'I love it.', '2005-03-21 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241616, 156895, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great macro, lighting and colours are perfect. Personally the composition feels a little tight and a touch awkward, but from a technical standpoint you are dead on.</td>', 'Great macro, lighting and colours are perfect. Personally the composition feels a little tight and a touch awkward, but from a technical standpoint you are dead on.', '2005-03-21 18:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241618, 157490, 7599, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour and great focus on the flowers. For more impact I don''t know if I would have cropped the bottom quite so tight and your DOF could have ben a bit better. You don''t want anything to compete with the beauty of the flowers which you have captured so well.</td>', 'Very nice colour and great focus on the flowers. For more impact I don''t know if I would have cropped the bottom quite so tight and your DOF could have ben a bit better. You don''t want anything to compete with the beauty of the flowers which you have captured so well.', '2005-03-21 18:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241623, 157172, 7599, '<td valign="top">Call me crazy but it almost looks like condensation on the glass blurred the lines somewhat. I think with this type of image you either have to have razor sharp focus or an obvious intentional all round softness. Of course I realize this type of shot is very tricky and I think you have done a good job.</td>', 'Call me crazy but it almost looks like condensation on the glass blurred the lines somewhat. I think with this type of image you either have to have razor sharp focus or an obvious intentional all round softness. Of course I realize this type of shot is very tricky and I think you have done a good job.', '2005-03-21 18:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241630, 158069, 33846, '<td valign="top">very nice shot<br/></td>', 'very nice shot', '2005-03-21 18:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241632, 157444, 7599, '<td valign="top">Unique idea. The tricky lighting has been done very well I just don''t know how much this image grabs me. I think I''ll have to come back and take another look at it, as it is unusual and worthy of a second look before giving a final score.</td>', 'Unique idea. The tricky lighting has been done very well I just don''t know how much this image grabs me. I think I''ll have to come back and take another look at it, as it is unusual and worthy of a second look before giving a final score.', '2005-03-21 18:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
