(1241637, 157994, 7599, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting, excellent reflection. To be picky the only thing I would have changed was the arrangement of your colours. The brights ones in the front or less of a red/black mixture might have added impact.</td>', 'Perfect lighting, excellent reflection. To be picky the only thing I would have changed was the arrangement of your colours. The brights ones in the front or less of a red/black mixture might have added impact.', '2005-03-21 18:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
