(1241641, 157633, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like the simple composition and the compelling color palette.  I''m finding the cloning tool marks left by the clean-up around the bananas distracting (If you''re using a Wintel monitor its possible the marks just to the left of the bananas blend invisibly into the background.)</td>', 'I like the simple composition and the compelling color palette.  I''m finding the cloning tool marks left by the clean-up around the bananas distracting (If you''re using a Wintel monitor its possible the marks just to the left of the bananas blend invisibly into the background.)', '2005-03-21 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241642, 156812, 7599, '<td valign="top">Cute little dpchallenge addition there. This is a hard image to comment on as there is nothing technically wrong with it, it just doesn''t pop out at me. I think this would be a good stock photo with limited selling potential given the nature of it. (and no that doesn''t really effect my score)</td>', 'Cute little dpchallenge addition there. This is a hard image to comment on as there is nothing technically wrong with it, it just doesn''t pop out at me. I think this would be a good stock photo with limited selling potential given the nature of it. (and no that doesn''t really effect my score)', '2005-03-21 18:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241645, 156837, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the compositon and the lighting.  The detail is exquisite.  It''s a quibble, but I find those looming empty nostrils a little disturbing, though I can''t think of a good solution to the problem.</td>', 'I love the compositon and the lighting.  The detail is exquisite.  It''s a quibble, but I find those looming empty nostrils a little disturbing, though I can''t think of a good solution to the problem.', '2005-03-21 18:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241646, 157313, 33435, '<td valign="top">Woah!!!!  One of the neatest photographs I have ever seen.  10  I can''t wait to see what post processing you did to this.  Selective sponge and dodge? Absolutely stunning!</td>', 'Woah!!!!  One of the neatest photographs I have ever seen.  10  I can''t wait to see what post processing you did to this.  Selective sponge and dodge? Absolutely stunning!', '2005-03-21 18:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241647, 158049, 7599, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this was a very hard photo to capture - marks for that. However as a stock photo I think it is a little too pixilated and the focus not very sharp. There should have been a sharp focus on the biker and the rest of the image softer or the rest of the image sharp and the biker motion blurred. I think the focus rests somewhere between the two. Were you a distance away and this is a crop of the original photograph?</td>', 'I''m sure this was a very hard photo to capture - marks for that. However as a stock photo I think it is a little too pixilated and the focus not very sharp. There should have been a sharp focus on the biker and the rest of the image softer or the rest of the image sharp and the biker motion blurred. I think the focus rests somewhere between the two. Were you a distance away and this is a crop of the original photograph?', '2005-03-21 18:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241648, 158183, 33560, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject &amp; take.   Nice focus &amp; compositon.  For all its many positive qualities, the photo doesn''t connect with me, but I don''t know why.</td>', 'Interesting subject & take.   Nice focus & compositon.  For all its many positive qualities, the photo doesn''t connect with me, but I don''t know why.', '2005-03-21 18:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
