(1241653, 156553, 7599, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. Very nice.  Would not change a thing.</td>', 'Simple but effective. Very nice.  Would not change a thing.', '2005-03-21 18:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241658, 157950, 7599, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and I can see this being a useful stock photo. I think it''s just a tad too dark though. Considering aspirin is not an addictive substance, the dark treament makes them seem somewhat grim, which i don''t know is very effective given the subject.</td>', 'I like the idea and I can see this being a useful stock photo. I think it''s just a tad too dark though. Considering aspirin is not an addictive substance, the dark treament makes them seem somewhat grim, which i don''t know is very effective given the subject.', '2005-03-21 18:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241659, 157403, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like the out of focus background and the sepia treatment.  I guess this is a quibble, but if it is a ''White Tailed Deer" why do we not see the tail?  I love the branches above, they frame the deer nicely.  The stubble in front is distracting.</td>', 'I like the out of focus background and the sepia treatment.  I guess this is a quibble, but if it is a ''White Tailed Deer" why do we not see the tail?  I love the branches above, they frame the deer nicely.  The stubble in front is distracting.', '2005-03-21 18:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241661, 157394, 7599, '<td valign="top">Cute picture but the image doesn''t  jump out at me with an obvious stock use. I''m not saying it couldn''t sell, I think it would just be a harder sale.</td>', 'Cute picture but the image doesn''t  jump out at me with an obvious stock use. I''m not saying it couldn''t sell, I think it would just be a harder sale.', '2005-03-21 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
