(1241823, 158065, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like several aspects of this photo very much, yet the photo doesn''t quite work for me. I like this shot as an experiment.  The frames are really interesting. The subject has a warm and glowing smile.  The background is a pleasing complementary color and is nicely out of focus.<br/> <br/>I''m afraid those painted nails belie the title, and so do the subject''s ''all thumbs'' use of the calculator and her engagement with the photographer.  These first seem like problems with the title more than with the photo.     But I think the weakness is that for the reasons we''ve mentioned we don''t understand why such a pretty and evidently well adjusted young woman has all these frames stacked on her head.</td>', 'I like several aspects of this photo very much, yet the photo doesn''t quite work for me. I like this shot as an experiment.  The frames are really interesting. The subject has a warm and glowing smile.  The background is a pleasing complementary color and is nicely out of focus. I''m afraid those painted nails belie the title, and so do the subject''s ''all thumbs'' use of the calculator and her engagement with the photographer.  These first seem like problems with the title more than with the photo.     But I think the weakness is that for the reasons we''ve mentioned we don''t understand why such a pretty and evidently well adjusted young woman has all these frames stacked on her head.', '2005-03-21 19:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241833, 158163, 33560, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a costume!  The photo is sharp where it needs to be.  The colors are good, The composition is good, with the subject perfectly framed.  It''s evidently taken at a parade or public festival otherwise the unfortunatly placed elbow and shoulder would be elsewhere.</td>', 'That''s quite a costume!  The photo is sharp where it needs to be.  The colors are good, The composition is good, with the subject perfectly framed.  It''s evidently taken at a parade or public festival otherwise the unfortunatly placed elbow and shoulder would be elsewhere.', '2005-03-21 19:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
