(1241977, 156782, 17185, '<td valign="top">This has to be the most saleable of the lot, imho.</td>', 'This has to be the most saleable of the lot, imho.', '2005-03-21 21:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241980, 157949, 33560, '<td valign="top">Seems the boys are always headed in one direction and the girls in the other.  But then sometimes that''s what makes life interesting.</td>', 'Seems the boys are always headed in one direction and the girls in the other.  But then sometimes that''s what makes life interesting.', '2005-03-21 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241985, 158113, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love this place.  It is a place with history.  It is a place of people who have roots that go deep in their communities. At least that''s what I see.</td>', 'I love this place.  It is a place with history.  It is a place of people who have roots that go deep in their communities. At least that''s what I see.', '2005-03-21 21:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241988, 157213, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea.  It''s pretty well executed, but in my opinion it could be improved a bit by using a faster flash or strobe.   The blue is a perfect color to complement the berry, but the highlights of the water don''t quite reach their potential against it. (These are, however, mere quibbles.)</td>', 'This is a great idea.  It''s pretty well executed, but in my opinion it could be improved a bit by using a faster flash or strobe.   The blue is a perfect color to complement the berry, but the highlights of the water don''t quite reach their potential against it. (These are, however, mere quibbles.)', '2005-03-21 21:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241996, 158187, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and textures.  It''s a simple and compelling photo, but its elegance quickly reveals its several subtle flaws.The brass fixtures look just a tad out of focus and the rest of the photo looks a tad unsharp.  Also it''s rotated about a degree or so clockwise.</td>', 'I love the colors and textures.  It''s a simple and compelling photo, but its elegance quickly reveals its several subtle flaws.The brass fixtures look just a tad out of focus and the rest of the photo looks a tad unsharp.  Also it''s rotated about a degree or so clockwise.', '2005-03-21 21:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1241998, 157653, 33560, '<td valign="top">Not a compelling example of the rose and most of it is out of focus.</td>', 'Not a compelling example of the rose and most of it is out of focus.', '2005-03-21 21:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242003, 158137, 33560, '<td valign="top">Or landing.  It''s actually made much better by the fact that the bird is landing.  Soaring can be boring.</td>', 'Or landing.  It''s actually made much better by the fact that the bird is landing.  Soaring can be boring.', '2005-03-21 21:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242009, 158133, 33560, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo down to the painted part. Below that I find the details in the vase ugly  Unfortunately cropping would destroy the intricate balance.</td>', 'I really like the photo down to the painted part. Below that I find the details in the vase ugly  Unfortunately cropping would destroy the intricate balance.', '2005-03-21 21:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242030, 156271, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really graphic and engaging photo. It looks like you have a bit of motion blur in it, though. 7</td>', 'Really graphic and engaging photo. It looks like you have a bit of motion blur in it, though. 7', '2005-03-21 21:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242035, 157026, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very clear and lovely photo. You might try widening the shot to provide some negative space at up and right. Nice tones and focus.</td>', 'Very clear and lovely photo. You might try widening the shot to provide some negative space at up and right. Nice tones and focus.', '2005-03-21 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
