(1242164, 157938, 14735, '<td valign="top">Let''s see the top left part of the photo is beautiful the bottom left is beautiful the right is wonderful. I think it is a 1 or a 0. OK maybe in between. 10</td>', 'Let''s see the top left part of the photo is beautiful the bottom left is beautiful the right is wonderful. I think it is a 1 or a 0. OK maybe in between. 10', '2005-03-21 22:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242194, 156124, 33361, '<td valign="top">little too soft focus</td>', 'little too soft focus', '2005-03-21 23:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242196, 158085, 7599, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one to comment on. I think I need to just go with my first impression, which was: "What am I supposed to be looking at?"  There is not really a point of focus in this image. The dock poles are in focus, but they are sort of divided up, so my eyes go in two directions. Then there is a seagull that is center stage, but not really occupying enough of the picture in comparison to the poles to keep the eye on that spot. I think the idea was there, but maybe a slightly better composition would have upped the wow factor.</td>', 'This is a tough one to comment on. I think I need to just go with my first impression, which was: "What am I supposed to be looking at?"  There is not really a point of focus in this image. The dock poles are in focus, but they are sort of divided up, so my eyes go in two directions. Then there is a seagull that is center stage, but not really occupying enough of the picture in comparison to the poles to keep the eye on that spot. I think the idea was there, but maybe a slightly better composition would have upped the wow factor.', '2005-03-21 23:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242197, 157378, 33361, '<td valign="top">do not like the hair across her eye..otherwise fabulous face, expression and lighting.</td>', 'do not like the hair across her eye..otherwise fabulous face, expression and lighting.', '2005-03-21 23:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242201, 156830, 33361, '<td valign="top">think this would be more effective in b&amp;w</td>', 'think this would be more effective in b&w', '2005-03-21 23:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242202, 157921, 33361, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it but it''s interesting</td>', 'I don''t get it but it''s interesting', '2005-03-21 23:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242211, 158136, 7599, '<td valign="top">Technically this photo is very good, the lighting and DOF as perfect. However, I think too many distractions around the stomach have taken some of the focus away from the message. The hands really dont look that elegant at this angle; If they had been lying by her side while retaining the necklaces on the belly in my opinion, the image would have been more powerful.</td>', 'Technically this photo is very good, the lighting and DOF as perfect. However, I think too many distractions around the stomach have taken some of the focus away from the message. The hands really dont look that elegant at this angle; If they had been lying by her side while retaining the necklaces on the belly in my opinion, the image would have been more powerful.', '2005-03-21 23:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242219, 156648, 7599, '<td valign="top">Very nice, certainly looks a lot warmed then where I am right now. I like the angle, while becoming more popular these days this type of shot looks great when done well. (As it is here) The only thing that I would have looked at improving is the blown highlights at the top..but I imagine it was pretty hard in the bright sun to avoid those.</td>', 'Very nice, certainly looks a lot warmed then where I am right now. I like the angle, while becoming more popular these days this type of shot looks great when done well. (As it is here) The only thing that I would have looked at improving is the blown highlights at the top..but I imagine it was pretty hard in the bright sun to avoid those.', '2005-03-21 23:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242226, 157971, 7599, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The focus and lighting is great. I wonder though if you tried this shot with the  pot/kettle out of frame? I think the liquid and the mug could have carried the picture and it would have left you with some nice negative space at the top. Hard to say though without seeing it.</td>', 'Nicely done. The focus and lighting is great. I wonder though if you tried this shot with the  pot/kettle out of frame? I think the liquid and the mug could have carried the picture and it would have left you with some nice negative space at the top. Hard to say though without seeing it.', '2005-03-21 23:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242228, 157512, 7599, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, the yellow background really adds to the overall effect. As much as I try to leave constructive comments, i really can''t think of what i would change about this.</td>', 'Great DOF, the yellow background really adds to the overall effect. As much as I try to leave constructive comments, i really can''t think of what i would change about this.', '2005-03-21 23:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
