(1242665, 158187, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the rich colors and strong lines in this picture - but it doesn''t seem like the strongest example of stock photography. From my surveying of several books of stock photography, I never saw this sort of thing. Lovely picture, just a dubious connection to the challenge in my mind.</td>', 'I like the rich colors and strong lines in this picture - but it doesn''t seem like the strongest example of stock photography. From my surveying of several books of stock photography, I never saw this sort of thing. Lovely picture, just a dubious connection to the challenge in my mind.', '2005-03-22 06:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242668, 156930, 17507, '<td valign="top">This is the coolest shot I''ve seen of the moon in a long time. Moon pictures are so frequently taken when it''s full, so you don''t get the great detail in the craters. I really like this picture.</td>', 'This is the coolest shot I''ve seen of the moon in a long time. Moon pictures are so frequently taken when it''s full, so you don''t get the great detail in the craters. I really like this picture.', '2005-03-22 06:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242702, 158132, 31443, '<td valign="top">So this is how it''s done :)</td>', 'So this is how it''s done :)', '2005-03-22 06:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242711, 156686, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well done........Flight International might be interested in this :)</td>', 'Nice shot, well done........Flight International might be interested in this :)', '2005-03-22 06:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242713, 158109, 31955, '<td valign="top">Cool mantis.</td>', 'Cool mantis.', '2005-03-22 06:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242718, 158116, 18191, '<td valign="top">I don''t necessarily know the connection to stock, but based on photographic merit, this shot rocks in what looks to be a tricky metering situation.</td>', 'I don''t necessarily know the connection to stock, but based on photographic merit, this shot rocks in what looks to be a tricky metering situation.', '2005-03-22 07:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242720, 157971, 31443, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell it, awww if only there was a little vapor showing</td>', 'I can almost smell it, awww if only there was a little vapor showing', '2005-03-22 07:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242724, 157881, 31443, '<td valign="top">Would have like to see more of the bird, what colors!</td>', 'Would have like to see more of the bird, what colors!', '2005-03-22 07:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242726, 157938, 31443, '<td valign="top">You are lucky to witness such beauty, wish that branch wasn''t blocking his face...</td>', 'You are lucky to witness such beauty, wish that branch wasn''t blocking his face...', '2005-03-22 07:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242727, 158079, 31443, '<td valign="top">Not very clear at all :( would have been an interesting compostition</td>', 'Not very clear at all :( would have been an interesting compostition', '2005-03-22 07:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242728, 158133, 31443, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and oh so soft....lovely setup</td>', 'Very pretty and oh so soft....lovely setup', '2005-03-22 07:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242729, 156274, 31443, '<td valign="top">Too much reflection of outside elements</td>', 'Too much reflection of outside elements', '2005-03-22 07:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242738, 158136, 34618, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Can''t say if it would be "stock" or not, but it''s really great.</td>', 'Beautiful. Can''t say if it would be "stock" or not, but it''s really great.', '2005-03-22 07:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242739, 157458, 34618, '<td valign="top">Evocative and very "stock". Amazing colors.</td>', 'Evocative and very "stock". Amazing colors.', '2005-03-22 07:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242740, 157879, 34618, '<td valign="top">Interesting, nice texture, cool tagline.</td>', 'Interesting, nice texture, cool tagline.', '2005-03-22 07:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242745, 157589, 7599, '<td valign="top">Well my first reaction is to laugh, as I suspect most people will. But once you get past the chuckles, this is such a fantastic. Your DOF is amazing, focus dead on; even the colours are vivid and add to the overall appeal of the image. I only wish I could take a picture like this. I usually try to leave some constructive criticism on each photo but frankly there is nothing you can improve here and this image is so far out of my league I think you need to leave me a comment to help me improve. =)</td>', 'Well my first reaction is to laugh, as I suspect most people will. But once you get past the chuckles, this is such a fantastic. Your DOF is amazing, focus dead on; even the colours are vivid and add to the overall appeal of the image. I only wish I could take a picture like this. I usually try to leave some constructive criticism on each photo but frankly there is nothing you can improve here and this image is so far out of my league I think you need to leave me a comment to help me improve. =)', '2005-03-22 07:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242746, 157354, 7599, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Excellent angle and I like how you composed it so that the roof fits to each of the images edges.  The only thing I find slightly distracting is the tree (not like you can help that) and the sky looks a little light in comparision to the rest of the image.  Again not something you can really fix unless you take a picture on a stormy day or at sunrise/sunset.</td>', 'Very nice image. Excellent angle and I like how you composed it so that the roof fits to each of the images edges.  The only thing I find slightly distracting is the tree (not like you can help that) and the sky looks a little light in comparision to the rest of the image.  Again not something you can really fix unless you take a picture on a stormy day or at sunrise/sunset.', '2005-03-22 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242748, 157852, 7599, '<td valign="top">Very nice clean image. No curves/lines at all in the background, exellent job there. I imagine this was a pretty tricky subject in regards to lighting. A few blown areas, but nothing that is overly distracting or takes anything away from the image.</td>', 'Very nice clean image. No curves/lines at all in the background, exellent job there. I imagine this was a pretty tricky subject in regards to lighting. A few blown areas, but nothing that is overly distracting or takes anything away from the image.', '2005-03-22 07:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1242761, 157378, 31230, '<td valign="top">Love the sheer happiness that you were able to capture.</td>', 'Love the sheer happiness that you were able to capture.', '2005-03-22 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1);
