(1243001, 157270, 32236, '<td valign="top">Nice background. I like the way the blue contrasts with the orange in the lens. Maybe the shot could be improved if the UV filter was removed?  Its a little beat up and keeps us from really seeing the lens.</td>', 'Nice background. I like the way the blue contrasts with the orange in the lens. Maybe the shot could be improved if the UV filter was removed?  Its a little beat up and keeps us from really seeing the lens.', '2005-03-22 11:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
