(1244003, 156845, 17937, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  This looks and fits this challenge perfect.  Which is why you got a perfect score...</td>', 'Very nice photo.  This looks and fits this challenge perfect.  Which is why you got a perfect score...', '2005-03-22 21:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244009, 157872, 18367, '<td valign="top">This photo would be the perfect ad for "Butterfly World" in Florida.  I would like to commend you on what I consider a superb photo. The clarity, DOF, Bokeh and vibrant colours make this one of my favorites and it warrants a 10.</td>', 'This photo would be the perfect ad for "Butterfly World" in Florida.  I would like to commend you on what I consider a superb photo. The clarity, DOF, Bokeh and vibrant colours make this one of my favorites and it warrants a 10.', '2005-03-22 21:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244010, 157420, 6600, '<td valign="top">The other moon beat you out by 1 point (it had less noise, better detail), they are both great shots!  Super job!</td>', 'The other moon beat you out by 1 point (it had less noise, better detail), they are both great shots!  Super job!', '2005-03-22 21:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244013, 156930, 6600, '<td valign="top">You nudged the other moon by 1.  You both did a super job!</td>', 'You nudged the other moon by 1.  You both did a super job!', '2005-03-22 21:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244018, 158098, 17937, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you got everything black and white except for the rope but great photo.  Very creative.  Would love to know how you did that...</td>', 'Not sure how you got everything black and white except for the rope but great photo.  Very creative.  Would love to know how you did that...', '2005-03-22 21:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244020, 157895, 6600, '<td valign="top">Now these are nice kiwis!  Nice detail, exposed, composition.  Good stock.</td>', 'Now these are nice kiwis!  Nice detail, exposed, composition.  Good stock.', '2005-03-22 21:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244023, 158149, 6600, '<td valign="top">Best kite shot of the bunch! LOL - This could work well for stock.</td>', 'Best kite shot of the bunch! LOL - This could work well for stock.', '2005-03-22 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244025, 156930, 17937, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Wish I had a lense that could do this...</td>', 'Great photo.  Wish I had a lense that could do this...', '2005-03-22 21:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244026, 157741, 18367, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear the coyotes howling.  Seriously, this photograph is something one would expect to see on a travel brochure.  It has a very alluring quality to it, and makes me wish I was there.  Too bad the moon was not a tad lower, but you certainly have oodles of stars.  I can''t give you as many points as there are stars in the sky, but I can give you 10.</td>', 'I can almost hear the coyotes howling.  Seriously, this photograph is something one would expect to see on a travel brochure.  It has a very alluring quality to it, and makes me wish I was there.  Too bad the moon was not a tad lower, but you certainly have oodles of stars.  I can''t give you as many points as there are stars in the sky, but I can give you 10.', '2005-03-22 21:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244038, 157242, 6600, '<td valign="top">The best tit shot in the challenge!  Keep up the good work.  Very nice sharpness and use of DOF.  Great job!</td>', 'The best tit shot in the challenge!  Keep up the good work.  Very nice sharpness and use of DOF.  Great job!', '2005-03-22 21:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244052, 158039, 32402, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity, simplicity and truth.</td>', 'I like the creativity, simplicity and truth.', '2005-03-22 22:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244105, 157452, 27812, '<td valign="top">great pic, definately a 10 from me. good luck, I hope you make it!</td>', 'great pic, definately a 10 from me. good luck, I hope you make it!', '2005-03-22 22:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244122, 157872, 16838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2005-03-22 22:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244125, 158070, 20168, '<td valign="top">Classy stock photo, though the pot base is too dark in contrast to the flower top brightness in my opinion.  I would also have removed the fake butterfly (if it is indeed a fake).  I like the black backdrop.</td>', 'Classy stock photo, though the pot base is too dark in contrast to the flower top brightness in my opinion.  I would also have removed the fake butterfly (if it is indeed a fake).  I like the black backdrop.', '2005-03-22 22:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244127, 158050, 20168, '<td valign="top">Apart from the distracting stripmall in the background, this photo has a lot going for it, with the lovely water lines of movement, and the blue sky with clouds.</td>', 'Apart from the distracting stripmall in the background, this photo has a lot going for it, with the lovely water lines of movement, and the blue sky with clouds.', '2005-03-22 22:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244131, 157984, 20168, '<td valign="top">Not enough context to understand the action, either of the water or of the kayaker.  Great colors and stop action in the water.</td>', 'Not enough context to understand the action, either of the water or of the kayaker.  Great colors and stop action in the water.', '2005-03-22 22:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244132, 157510, 20168, '<td valign="top">Sell it to the U.S. Postal Service!  Great stock shot.</td>', 'Sell it to the U.S. Postal Service!  Great stock shot.', '2005-03-22 22:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244137, 156421, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great stock photo!  I love the angle, the lighting, the color, the clarity, the simplicity, the concept... One of my favorites to win this one.</td>', 'Great stock photo!  I love the angle, the lighting, the color, the clarity, the simplicity, the concept... One of my favorites to win this one.', '2005-03-22 22:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244141, 157584, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great stock landscape photo, with rich earth tones and a great depth of field.  Excellent entry.</td>', 'Great stock landscape photo, with rich earth tones and a great depth of field.  Excellent entry.', '2005-03-22 22:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244144, 157865, 20168, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this photo, as well as the colors.  Great choice and texturing in the editing stages.  That glimmer on the horizon is tantalizing enough to give this photo that added allure.  Cool shot.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this photo, as well as the colors.  Great choice and texturing in the editing stages.  That glimmer on the horizon is tantalizing enough to give this photo that added allure.  Cool shot.', '2005-03-22 22:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244167, 156032, 24976, '<td valign="top">imo doesnt need the frame as a ''stock photo''... nice photo thought. the sky is borderline really cool / wierd.</td>', 'imo doesnt need the frame as a ''stock photo''... nice photo thought. the sky is borderline really cool / wierd.', '2005-03-22 23:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1244185, 156782, 32792, '<td valign="top">I just love the way the green pill (it''s a pill right?) looks amongst all those white ones! The contrast is great........<br/>bumping it up to a 10<br/>Totally meets the challenge......sure to be on top 10</td>', 'I just love the way the green pill (it''s a pill right?) looks amongst all those white ones! The contrast is great........bumping it up to a 10Totally meets the challenge......sure to be on top 10', '2005-03-22 23:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
