(1245462, 157331, 13305, '<td valign="top">I think some of the vocabulary on the board might not be in time with the period depicted.  That''s a minor problem.</td>', 'I think some of the vocabulary on the board might not be in time with the period depicted.  That''s a minor problem.', '2005-03-23 12:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1245463, 158114, 34396, '<td valign="top">You certainly got the colors right.  Immediatly makes me think of Lucky Charms!  I don''t care for the shadow in the lower right.  If that was gone, +1</td>', 'You certainly got the colors right.  Immediatly makes me think of Lucky Charms!  I don''t care for the shadow in the lower right.  If that was gone, +1', '2005-03-23 12:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1245467, 157500, 13305, '<td valign="top">The light in the upper right hand of the picture distracts from the focus of the picture, the horse.  Good attempt, keep on trying.</td>', 'The light in the upper right hand of the picture distracts from the focus of the picture, the horse.  Good attempt, keep on trying.', '2005-03-23 12:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1245476, 158123, 34396, '<td valign="top">Ready for someone to be picky?  The very top of the photo appears to have some ripples in the fabric.  I would have cropped just a bit more from the top to eliminate this.  Lighting is good, focus seems to fail on the legs and back of baby.  I would have used smaller fstop to increase DOF, or maybe softened it a bit more?</td>', 'Ready for someone to be picky?  The very top of the photo appears to have some ripples in the fabric.  I would have cropped just a bit more from the top to eliminate this.  Lighting is good, focus seems to fail on the legs and back of baby.  I would have used smaller fstop to increase DOF, or maybe softened it a bit more?', '2005-03-23 12:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1245480, 157884, 34396, '<td valign="top">Cute shot,  Lighting is a bit harsh on right side of face.  Background is distracting.</td>', 'Cute shot,  Lighting is a bit harsh on right side of face.  Background is distracting.', '2005-03-23 12:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
