(1245497, 157510, 33421, '<td valign="top">Kick ass dude love it , did give it a nine originally but i think 10 is more suited...could not be better!</td>', 'Kick ass dude love it , did give it a nine originally but i think 10 is more suited...could not be better!', '2005-03-23 13:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
