(1245537, 157695, 34396, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo.  The cropping is maybe a bit too limiting.  Although I like the lineup of flags, I am left wondering: "If I moved back and to the left a bit more, would the shot have more interest?"</td>', 'Not a bad photo.  The cropping is maybe a bit too limiting.  Although I like the lineup of flags, I am left wondering: "If I moved back and to the left a bit more, would the shot have more interest?"', '2005-03-23 13:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
