(1245681, 157490, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image seems a little small. In some ways the close crop can be good to avoid the background but I think this may be a little too tight. The coloring is good. I think the image is a little too static to be overly appealing, but flowers are certainly a good stock subject.</td>', 'The image seems a little small. In some ways the close crop can be good to avoid the background but I think this may be a little too tight. The coloring is good. I think the image is a little too static to be overly appealing, but flowers are certainly a good stock subject.', '2005-03-23 14:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1245687, 158163, 22872, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Mardi Gras!!</td>', 'Reminds me of Mardi Gras!!', '2005-03-23 14:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1245692, 158000, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not sure if that is another seal in front or a rock (looks like a rock, tho), but I''d be tempted to crop the bottom up to the start of the rock. The OOF foreground isnt a distraction and the focus moves back to the seals. The colors are good and I like the layers.</td>', 'Not sure if that is another seal in front or a rock (looks like a rock, tho), but I''d be tempted to crop the bottom up to the start of the rock. The OOF foreground isnt a distraction and the focus moves back to the seals. The colors are good and I like the layers.', '2005-03-23 14:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1245696, 156747, 22872, '<td valign="top">What I like about this photo is that you know exactly what is going on.  The background colors seem a little dull/bland?  I think if they were brighter it could be a seller</td>', 'What I like about this photo is that you know exactly what is going on.  The background colors seem a little dull/bland?  I think if they were brighter it could be a seller', '2005-03-23 14:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
