(1248977, 158097, 6804, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape!    I like it as it is, and the colors appear true to life.  But I think just a little mid tone compression could give the foreground a little more detail and would add some definition to the clouds as well. it might just give it a little snap. I really like the graduation of light and color into the distance.  The purple flowers on the right are perfectly placed and the abundance of color on the ground tells the story about the season and life in the desert.  9<br/>(I''m glad you didn''t straighten the frame to the trees).</td>', 'Beautiful landscape!    I like it as it is, and the colors appear true to life.  But I think just a little mid tone compression could give the foreground a little more detail and would add some definition to the clouds as well. it might just give it a little snap. I really like the graduation of light and color into the distance.  The purple flowers on the right are perfectly placed and the abundance of color on the ground tells the story about the season and life in the desert.  9(I''m glad you didn''t straighten the frame to the trees).', '2005-03-25 02:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1248987, 157458, 6804, '<td valign="top">Stunning sunset.  Remarkable capture in every way.  This will fit in many places.  Great stock photo.   10</td>', 'Stunning sunset.  Remarkable capture in every way.  This will fit in many places.  Great stock photo.   10', '2005-03-25 02:29:49.000000', NULL, 1);
