(1249238, 157873, 33924, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Manuel, perhaps? Narrow DOF is excellent and backlighting of spraying water is very nice. The child''s arm reaching up to the faucet pulls it all together very nicely. 9</td>', 'Lovely shot. Manuel, perhaps? Narrow DOF is excellent and backlighting of spraying water is very nice. The child''s arm reaching up to the faucet pulls it all together very nicely. 9', '2005-03-25 09:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249240, 157584, 33924, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing. The golden colors contrasted with the blues in the distance are so lovely. And the details of the nearer portions of the canyon are very clear. Gorgeous shot. 9</td>', 'Excellent framing. The golden colors contrasted with the blues in the distance are so lovely. And the details of the nearer portions of the canyon are very clear. Gorgeous shot. 9', '2005-03-25 09:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249243, 157741, 33924, '<td valign="top">This is such a magical shot. The light of the moon coming from top right  and the light of the sun on the horizon are lovely. Also, the curving topography cut through by the cactus makes this shot one of the best in this challenge. I give it a 9.</td>', 'This is such a magical shot. The light of the moon coming from top right  and the light of the sun on the horizon are lovely. Also, the curving topography cut through by the cactus makes this shot one of the best in this challenge. I give it a 9.', '2005-03-25 09:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
