(1249546, 156608, 29269, '<td valign="top">I think that I''ve seen this perspective in just about every magazine I open these days. Usually used on the 1/3rd page ads, apparently has enough appeal to be used again and again. Therefore, <br/>meets challenge: 10; <br/>composition:10; <br/>maybe a little harsh lighting on a shiny blouse:8; <br/>and the model is beautiful (no grade for that, would have been a 10 if that was also graded:-)<br/> <br/>bumping up on the second pass. 9.</td>', 'I think that I''ve seen this perspective in just about every magazine I open these days. Usually used on the 1/3rd page ads, apparently has enough appeal to be used again and again. Therefore, meets challenge: 10; composition:10; maybe a little harsh lighting on a shiny blouse:8; and the model is beautiful (no grade for that, would have been a 10 if that was also graded:-) bumping up on the second pass. 9.', '2005-03-25 14:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
