(1249553, 158196, 29269, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that framing was necessary. It could be DPC''s gray background and the frame you get from DPC that contributes to the looks, but i''d like to see it without one.<br/>Other than that, meets the challenge: 10, composition is for 10, and the only technicality is that the hand seems to be too bright. Bumping up to 9</td>', 'I don''t think that framing was necessary. It could be DPC''s gray background and the frame you get from DPC that contributes to the looks, but i''d like to see it without one.Other than that, meets the challenge: 10, composition is for 10, and the only technicality is that the hand seems to be too bright. Bumping up to 9', '2005-03-25 14:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
