(1250285, 157856, 25232, '<td valign="top">Really good clean image. I know you are going to get hit on this challenge by the clueless who seem to be under the impression that it is some taboo to have branded product as a leading feature of a stock image, but don''t worry, this is a good stock image.</td>', 'Really good clean image. I know you are going to get hit on this challenge by the clueless who seem to be under the impression that it is some taboo to have branded product as a leading feature of a stock image, but don''t worry, this is a good stock image.', '2005-03-26 03:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
