(1250396, 157910, 15920, '<td valign="top">I''ve got a Keeshond who never sits this still for photo opps.  He has none of the brown coloring here, but, he does have that majestic look.  Nicely done.  The one slight thing I might do is blur the background just a bit (not enough to loose the context, but enough to put all attention on the subject.)  Hope you win.</td>', 'I''ve got a Keeshond who never sits this still for photo opps.  He has none of the brown coloring here, but, he does have that majestic look.  Nicely done.  The one slight thing I might do is blur the background just a bit (not enough to loose the context, but enough to put all attention on the subject.)  Hope you win.', '2005-03-26 08:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250397, 158119, 22340, '<td valign="top">nice exposure and dof to isolate bee altho would have liked to have seen frame shifted slightly left to place bee in right third of photo</td>', 'nice exposure and dof to isolate bee altho would have liked to have seen frame shifted slightly left to place bee in right third of photo', '2005-03-26 08:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
