(1250403, 157881, 25464, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice, but it looks a bit oversaturated to me.  A catch light in the eye would have improved as well.</td>', 'The composition is nice, but it looks a bit oversaturated to me.  A catch light in the eye would have improved as well.', '2005-03-26 08:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
