(1250465, 158116, 2022, '<td valign="top">There is some pleasing atmosphere about this picture, its composition and simplicity. It is one of my favorites in this challenge. I hope it will do well. (10)</td>', 'There is some pleasing atmosphere about this picture, its composition and simplicity. It is one of my favorites in this challenge. I hope it will do well. (10)', '2005-03-26 10:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
