(1251030, 157938, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is so close to being the perfect photograph.  There are so many things right about it:  color, dof, composition, interest.  It''s just that darn branch in front of the birds face that ruins it!  And I know you had no control over it.  Your skill as a photographer really shows through on this photo, but since it''s advanced editing rules I probably would have cloned the heck out of that branch!  :)  Good luck!</td>', 'This is so close to being the perfect photograph.  There are so many things right about it:  color, dof, composition, interest.  It''s just that darn branch in front of the birds face that ruins it!  And I know you had no control over it.  Your skill as a photographer really shows through on this photo, but since it''s advanced editing rules I probably would have cloned the heck out of that branch!  :)  Good luck!', '2005-03-26 15:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
