(1252013, 157656, 28108, '<td valign="top">Very cool !  It would look great in a science book.  The light reflections are too bright and that is distracting.  But I like the little fellow !</td>', 'Very cool !  It would look great in a science book.  The light reflections are too bright and that is distracting.  But I like the little fellow !', '2005-03-27 04:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
