(1252089, 156427, 3306, '<td valign="top">Comical and technically well done but the armamentarian is not very realistic ie. are not dental instruments,  and the teeth and tongue do not look real.</td>', 'Comical and technically well done but the armamentarian is not very realistic ie. are not dental instruments,  and the teeth and tongue do not look real.', '2005-03-27 07:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
