(1252149, 158102, 32997, '<td valign="top">I like that the lion is looking towards the light here-yet the shadows don''t seem to be working in your favour, rather than creating a dramatic effect they detract from its focus. In the top left the face almost blends into the wall, bottom left foot, left arm work best.</td>', 'I like that the lion is looking towards the light here-yet the shadows don''t seem to be working in your favour, rather than creating a dramatic effect they detract from its focus. In the top left the face almost blends into the wall, bottom left foot, left arm work best.', '2005-03-27 10:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
