(1252157, 157723, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great set-up and colour. Are the strawberries frozen? Stange glaze/shine on second to the left..and a couple on the right. Not a big deal, I like the shot.</td>', 'Great set-up and colour. Are the strawberries frozen? Stange glaze/shine on second to the left..and a couple on the right. Not a big deal, I like the shot.', '2005-03-27 10:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
