(1252189, 157352, 31443, '<td valign="top">So this is where the Easter Bunny went?? Cute photo a tad overexposed or dodged but nice....</td>', 'So this is where the Easter Bunny went?? Cute photo a tad overexposed or dodged but nice....', '2005-03-27 10:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252205, 157889, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very sharp focus and the color makes my mouth water!  Now, I''ve never won a ribbon -- and you probably have -- but there are 3 suggestions I would offer.  1.  My eye keeps going to the shiny spot on the strawberry; diffused lighting may have softened that.  2. Diffused lighting would probably soften the harsh shadow behind the strawberry.  3.  I know that the rule of thirds is just a guideline, but I think it would have helped here.  The use of that nice white negative space with the strawberry on one of the crosshairs would have really drawn attention it.  Hope this is helpful :)</td>', 'Very sharp focus and the color makes my mouth water!  Now, I''ve never won a ribbon -- and you probably have -- but there are 3 suggestions I would offer.  1.  My eye keeps going to the shiny spot on the strawberry; diffused lighting may have softened that.  2. Diffused lighting would probably soften the harsh shadow behind the strawberry.  3.  I know that the rule of thirds is just a guideline, but I think it would have helped here.  The use of that nice white negative space with the strawberry on one of the crosshairs would have really drawn attention it.  Hope this is helpful :)', '2005-03-27 11:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252207, 158079, 8624, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been a great shot without all of the wierd post processing. The low point of view is great as is the repetition of objects, but the negative effect just doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'I think this would have been a great shot without all of the wierd post processing. The low point of view is great as is the repetition of objects, but the negative effect just doesn''t do it for me.', '2005-03-27 11:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252208, 156553, 24065, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I''m so jealous of you folks who get to see this so often!  Great capture, colors and composition.</td>', 'Wow!  I''m so jealous of you folks who get to see this so often!  Great capture, colors and composition.', '2005-03-27 11:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252209, 157741, 30890, '<td valign="top">Your very lucky to be able to see such a sky. The last time I saw such a sight was when we had a power cut. Although my daughter lives on the Falklands and she say such sights are to be seen every night. Great shot</td>', 'Your very lucky to be able to see such a sky. The last time I saw such a sight was when we had a power cut. Although my daughter lives on the Falklands and she say such sights are to be seen every night. Great shot', '2005-03-27 11:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
