(1252249, 157420, 24065, '<td valign="top">Very good on many levels.  My only suggestion for improvement is that the black appears a little gray and somewhat noisy.  Of course, I''ve never won a ribbon -- so what do I know! :)  BOL  8</td>', 'Very good on many levels.  My only suggestion for improvement is that the black appears a little gray and somewhat noisy.  Of course, I''ve never won a ribbon -- so what do I know! :)  BOL  8', '2005-03-27 11:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
