(1252259, 157884, 24065, '<td valign="top">I thought I''d make a couple of observations in hopes that it would be helpful for future competitions.  One disclaimer: I''ve never ribboned myself!  So, take it or leave it! :)  Cute subject, by the way!  There''s a little too much light on the little fellow -- the highlights are blown out on his hair.  The background is too distracting.  It makes it look more like a snapshot than a stock photo.  Cropping a little more off the top and setting his head on the rule of thirds in the upper right corner may have helped the composition if there had been a better background.</td>', 'I thought I''d make a couple of observations in hopes that it would be helpful for future competitions.  One disclaimer: I''ve never ribboned myself!  So, take it or leave it! :)  Cute subject, by the way!  There''s a little too much light on the little fellow -- the highlights are blown out on his hair.  The background is too distracting.  It makes it look more like a snapshot than a stock photo.  Cropping a little more off the top and setting his head on the rule of thirds in the upper right corner may have helped the composition if there had been a better background.', '2005-03-27 11:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252262, 157686, 24065, '<td valign="top">The subject is very nice.  The photo appears off on white balance.  Was that a white background?  If so, using levels or curves in PS would correct that.   This comment is meant to be helpful, and it comes from someone who''s never ribboned :)  So take it or leave it!</td>', 'The subject is very nice.  The photo appears off on white balance.  Was that a white background?  If so, using levels or curves in PS would correct that.   This comment is meant to be helpful, and it comes from someone who''s never ribboned :)  So take it or leave it!', '2005-03-27 11:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252263, 158124, 24065, '<td valign="top">The composition is very nice.  I think the gull is probably a little too out of focus.  Hope this feedback is helpful :)</td>', 'The composition is very nice.  I think the gull is probably a little too out of focus.  Hope this feedback is helpful :)', '2005-03-27 11:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252310, 157855, 13091, '<td valign="top">Good picture.</td>', 'Good picture.', '2005-03-27 12:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252337, 157381, 33079, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition. Good job!</td>', 'Nice colors and composition. Good job!', '2005-03-27 12:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252351, 157403, 33079, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear image.<br/>Excellent!</td>', 'Very sharp and clear image.Excellent!', '2005-03-27 13:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252378, 157451, 28141, '<td valign="top">Needs more light on the left side of the face.  Highlighting one side is fine but it''s almost impossible to see the other side here.  Having one side be dark might work with a different composition, but I think a straight on face shoot cropped this way demands that the entire face be visible.</td>', 'Needs more light on the left side of the face.  Highlighting one side is fine but it''s almost impossible to see the other side here.  Having one side be dark might work with a different composition, but I think a straight on face shoot cropped this way demands that the entire face be visible.', '2005-03-27 13:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252493, 158123, 1031, '<td valign="top">If model-released, kid pics should sell well. The way the fingers are folded/hidden on the left hand is a little distracting, but not too important.</td>', 'If model-released, kid pics should sell well. The way the fingers are folded/hidden on the left hand is a little distracting, but not too important.', '2005-03-27 14:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252501, 157872, 1031, '<td valign="top">For stock, they''d probably want the scientific name for the title. Nice shot!</td>', 'For stock, they''d probably want the scientific name for the title. Nice shot!', '2005-03-27 14:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252503, 158010, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think for stock they''d rather have it in full, vibrant color. I like the composition.</td>', 'I think for stock they''d rather have it in full, vibrant color. I like the composition.', '2005-03-27 14:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252504, 156427, 1031, '<td valign="top">Extremely clever composition/execution, but I''m wondering what the intended "market" would be.</td>', 'Extremely clever composition/execution, but I''m wondering what the intended "market" would be.', '2005-03-27 14:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252507, 157024, 1031, '<td valign="top">For a stock image I think I''d boost the contrast and color saturation a bit -- you want your image to jump off the page and attract the attention of the purchaser.</td>', 'For a stock image I think I''d boost the contrast and color saturation a bit -- you want your image to jump off the page and attract the attention of the purchaser.', '2005-03-27 14:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252508, 157275, 1031, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting -- I was thinking of adjusting the angle, but I see it''s as straight as it''s going to get : )</td>', 'Like the lighting -- I was thinking of adjusting the angle, but I see it''s as straight as it''s going to get : )', '2005-03-27 14:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252511, 158187, 15032, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if you were straight-on from the door so that both the door frame and the horizontal board above the door were parallel to the border of the frame</td>', 'Would have been better if you were straight-on from the door so that both the door frame and the horizontal board above the door were parallel to the border of the frame', '2005-03-27 14:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252512, 158109, 1031, '<td valign="top">Stock agencies traditionally don''t like the photos to be bordered or "finished" like this. Lovely colors and creepy idea : )</td>', 'Stock agencies traditionally don''t like the photos to be bordered or "finished" like this. Lovely colors and creepy idea : )', '2005-03-27 14:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252515, 157599, 1031, '<td valign="top">If you have a model release you can sell a lot of these : )<br/> <br/>I might try and tweak the skin tone on the feet/lower legs to match the rest, and be careful of over-sharpening -- you are close to getting some haloing, and people expect baby pictures to be "soft."</td>', 'If you have a model release you can sell a lot of these : ) I might try and tweak the skin tone on the feet/lower legs to match the rest, and be careful of over-sharpening -- you are close to getting some haloing, and people expect baby pictures to be "soft."', '2005-03-27 14:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252517, 157865, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful landscape!<br/>Clean and clear with amazing DOF. excellent detail and placment of elements.  Great stock photo to fit a plethora of themes.  10</td>', 'This is a beautiful landscape!Clean and clear with amazing DOF. excellent detail and placment of elements.  Great stock photo to fit a plethora of themes.  10', '2005-03-27 15:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252523, 157695, 33520, '<td valign="top">Mint magyar szoritok neked,de szerintem egy kisse lefogjak pontozni a merete miatt!!</td>', 'Mint magyar szoritok neked,de szerintem egy kisse lefogjak pontozni a merete miatt!!', '2005-03-27 15:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252525, 158176, 6804, '<td valign="top">I love the title - Pax Vobiscum - Come unto Me all ye that are weary and heavy-laden and I will give you rest. Take My Yoke upon you and learn of Me, for I am Meek and Lowly in heart, and ye shall find Rest unto your souls.<br/> <br/>This is a beautiful capture. The lighting is phenomenal and the subject is quite appropriate for the week of Easter.  The detail is remarkable down into the shadows.  I simply couldn''t improve on this.  10</td>', 'I love the title - Pax Vobiscum - Come unto Me all ye that are weary and heavy-laden and I will give you rest. Take My Yoke upon you and learn of Me, for I am Meek and Lowly in heart, and ye shall find Rest unto your souls. This is a beautiful capture. The lighting is phenomenal and the subject is quite appropriate for the week of Easter.  The detail is remarkable down into the shadows.  I simply couldn''t improve on this.  10', '2005-03-27 15:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252540, 156402, 28141, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more powerful if the wing weren''t covering the "United States of America".  Without being able to see all the words, you have to look closely or recognize the paint job to figure out it''s Airforce One.  I think as a stock photo, potential buyers would want it to be easily recognizable--they need something that will make a fast impact on the viewer.  Without the Airforce One impact, it''s just another airplane.  It''s cool that you got a chance to shoot this though.</td>', 'I think this would be more powerful if the wing weren''t covering the "United States of America".  Without being able to see all the words, you have to look closely or recognize the paint job to figure out it''s Airforce One.  I think as a stock photo, potential buyers would want it to be easily recognizable--they need something that will make a fast impact on the viewer.  Without the Airforce One impact, it''s just another airplane.  It''s cool that you got a chance to shoot this though.', '2005-03-27 15:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252543, 157653, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice color, but the focus is too soft and the composition isn''t really interesting in any way.</td>', 'Nice color, but the focus is too soft and the composition isn''t really interesting in any way.', '2005-03-27 15:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252545, 157741, 28141, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition--I like the rounded shape of the horizon.</td>', 'Excellent composition--I like the rounded shape of the horizon.', '2005-03-27 15:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252550, 158158, 28141, '<td valign="top">Good composition and color, but something about this seems fake.  The snow(?) sort of looks like it was drawn in and the way the flower is positioned seems unnatural, like it was just stuck in the snow rather than actually growing there which I''m assuming is the effect you''re going for here.</td>', 'Good composition and color, but something about this seems fake.  The snow(?) sort of looks like it was drawn in and the way the flower is positioned seems unnatural, like it was just stuck in the snow rather than actually growing there which I''m assuming is the effect you''re going for here.', '2005-03-27 15:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252554, 156124, 28141, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more of the pepper in focus.</td>', 'Would like to see more of the pepper in focus.', '2005-03-27 15:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252556, 157366, 28141, '<td valign="top">Good in a technical sense, but as a stock photo, who would purchase this other than the Oxo company?</td>', 'Good in a technical sense, but as a stock photo, who would purchase this other than the Oxo company?', '2005-03-27 15:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252560, 156829, 28141, '<td valign="top">Seems a little oversharp.</td>', 'Seems a little oversharp.', '2005-03-27 15:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252565, 157510, 2333, '<td valign="top">The light here is very nice! Really like your choice of composition. Just a tad more DoF to include the nearest white feathers sharply would have been a plus, IMO. Still very nice work.</td>', 'The light here is very nice! Really like your choice of composition. Just a tad more DoF to include the nearest white feathers sharply would have been a plus, IMO. Still very nice work.', '2005-03-27 15:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252566, 158135, 28141, '<td valign="top">Too small...can''t see any detail.  And whats with the verticle lines?  I can''t tell if those are supposed to be there or not.  Shooting through a fence maybe?  It''s just too hard to tell at this size.</td>', 'Too small...can''t see any detail.  And whats with the verticle lines?  I can''t tell if those are supposed to be there or not.  Shooting through a fence maybe?  It''s just too hard to tell at this size.', '2005-03-27 15:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252568, 158133, 2333, '<td valign="top">Bumped up. I love how you lit this. Simple elegant. Kudos.</td>', 'Bumped up. I love how you lit this. Simple elegant. Kudos.', '2005-03-27 15:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252569, 158070, 28141, '<td valign="top">The pot is a little dark.</td>', 'The pot is a little dark.', '2005-03-27 15:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252571, 158063, 2333, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great detail. A bit less red (drop th ered channel in curves) and a bit more contrast would deemphasize the "sodium hase" in the distance.<br/>Edit: Forgot to mention earlier, there is a very small, but quite perceptible lean to the left. That''s perhaps more distracting than the haze.</td>', 'Nice composition, great detail. A bit less red (drop th ered channel in curves) and a bit more contrast would deemphasize the "sodium hase" in the distance.Edit: Forgot to mention earlier, there is a very small, but quite perceptible lean to the left. That''s perhaps more distracting than the haze.', '2005-03-27 15:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252573, 157971, 2333, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, smell that java! I like the simplicity, the juxtaposition of the monochrome cup, saucer, pot with the rich coffee. Well lit, well composed. Nice work.</td>', 'Mmmm, smell that java! I like the simplicity, the juxtaposition of the monochrome cup, saucer, pot with the rich coffee. Well lit, well composed. Nice work.', '2005-03-27 15:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252578, 157971, 32570, '<td valign="top">Great lighting without blowing anything out.  Very well done.</td>', 'Great lighting without blowing anything out.  Very well done.', '2005-03-27 15:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252579, 158163, 2333, '<td valign="top">How very strange indeed, and how perfectly captured. His look, straight at the camera, really makes this. Your exposure is spot on. The only distraction is whatever is intruding at lower left, but I''m sure you''ve heard that already ;-)</td>', 'How very strange indeed, and how perfectly captured. His look, straight at the camera, really makes this. Your exposure is spot on. The only distraction is whatever is intruding at lower left, but I''m sure you''ve heard that already ;-)', '2005-03-27 15:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252582, 158074, 32570, '<td valign="top">I''m casting votes based not only on how "pretty" the pictures is, but also if it would be a useable stock photo.  This one falls into the "useful" catagory.  Well done.</td>', 'I''m casting votes based not only on how "pretty" the pictures is, but also if it would be a useable stock photo.  This one falls into the "useful" catagory.  Well done.', '2005-03-27 15:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252583, 158075, 2333, '<td valign="top">What an awesome sky. The surfline leading in from hte lower left is very nice compositionally. I want to see the paraplane a bit closer. Maybe a bit tighter crop?</td>', 'What an awesome sky. The surfline leading in from hte lower left is very nice compositionally. I want to see the paraplane a bit closer. Maybe a bit tighter crop?', '2005-03-27 15:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252588, 156829, 2333, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution. Perfect juxtaposition of the machine and bare foreground against the pristine background. Speaks volumes. It does seem a little oversharpened, there are halos visible. That''s a minor nit. Also a bit of red cast genreally.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution. Perfect juxtaposition of the machine and bare foreground against the pristine background. Speaks volumes. It does seem a little oversharpened, there are halos visible. That''s a minor nit. Also a bit of red cast genreally.', '2005-03-27 16:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252669, 156844, 31566, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors!</td>', 'Very cool colors!', '2005-03-27 17:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252670, 157262, 31566, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat idea!</td>', 'This is a really neat idea!', '2005-03-27 17:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252671, 157994, 31566, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and great focus too.  Good job!</td>', 'I really like the composition and great focus too.  Good job!', '2005-03-27 17:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252674, 158182, 31566, '<td valign="top">Well composed and nice work on the background!</td>', 'Well composed and nice work on the background!', '2005-03-27 17:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252675, 157877, 31566, '<td valign="top">These are truly beautiful.  Nice job!</td>', 'These are truly beautiful.  Nice job!', '2005-03-27 17:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252677, 158057, 31566, '<td valign="top">Nice focus...good stock photo</td>', 'Nice focus...good stock photo', '2005-03-27 17:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252678, 158054, 31566, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a great stock photo....good job.</td>', 'I think this would be a great stock photo....good job.', '2005-03-27 17:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252681, 158098, 31566, '<td valign="top">Wow....very powerful!  Love the colors of the twine!</td>', 'Wow....very powerful!  Love the colors of the twine!', '2005-03-27 17:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252699, 156840, 2333, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing on this... the contrast between the warm tones of the sand adn the rich purple of the BG mountains is beautiful. I like your use of the foreground object. <br/>there is a slight halo over the mountains, might be USM artifact?</td>', 'Perfect timing on this... the contrast between the warm tones of the sand adn the rich purple of the BG mountains is beautiful. I like your use of the foreground object. there is a slight halo over the mountains, might be USM artifact?', '2005-03-27 18:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252706, 158074, 2333, '<td valign="top">Very "stock." Nicely executed. If the in-focus function key were the F1 key, that would put the exclamation point on it...</td>', 'Very "stock." Nicely executed. If the in-focus function key were the F1 key, that would put the exclamation point on it...', '2005-03-27 18:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252733, 158179, 17507, '<td valign="top">Interestingly weird focal point and composition. For stock photography, I think the message is supposed to be as blatantly clear as possible... so for that I might have done this in color, kept the heart right side up, and made it the focal point of the composition, probably zooming in to just the heart and the point embedded in it.</td>', 'Interestingly weird focal point and composition. For stock photography, I think the message is supposed to be as blatantly clear as possible... so for that I might have done this in color, kept the heart right side up, and made it the focal point of the composition, probably zooming in to just the heart and the point embedded in it.', '2005-03-27 18:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252752, 156732, 28141, '<td valign="top">Pinecone is too shadowy.</td>', 'Pinecone is too shadowy.', '2005-03-27 18:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252759, 158136, 28141, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I''m not sure who would purchase it as a stock photo.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I''m not sure who would purchase it as a stock photo.', '2005-03-27 18:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252768, 157379, 25742, '<td valign="top">the yellow border might be a little too much, but still on the workable side of things. Good work. /8</td>', 'the yellow border might be a little too much, but still on the workable side of things. Good work. /8', '2005-03-27 19:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252770, 158044, 32602, '<td valign="top">Without the title it is hard to immediately see what this is, which isn''t good for stock images. The ice is  in focus, but the colour, due to shadow or time of day<br/>leaves me wanting more context in the frame. This might have more merit as art than stock.</td>', 'Without the title it is hard to immediately see what this is, which isn''t good for stock images. The ice is  in focus, but the colour, due to shadow or time of dayleaves me wanting more context in the frame. This might have more merit as art than stock.', '2005-03-27 19:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252773, 157870, 25742, '<td valign="top">Reykjavíkurslippur er flottur.</td>', 'Reykjavíkurslippur er flottur.', '2005-03-27 19:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252777, 156784, 32602, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, good colour. Wish the shadow on the handrail bottome left wasn''t there.</td>', 'Lovely image, good colour. Wish the shadow on the handrail bottome left wasn''t there.', '2005-03-27 19:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252779, 157420, 25742, '<td valign="top">a little bit too much noise. other than that very good.</td>', 'a little bit too much noise. other than that very good.', '2005-03-27 19:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252781, 157975, 22781, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the soft shadow.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the soft shadow.', '2005-03-27 19:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252783, 157213, 22781, '<td valign="top">WOW is about the only thing I can say.<br/>I would never have the patience to set up a shot like this...<br/>10</td>', 'WOW is about the only thing I can say.I would never have the patience to set up a shot like this...10', '2005-03-27 19:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
