(1253829, 157994, 31606, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this challenge scuds, but I would say you need better focus.  If you would have gotten all the crayons in focus then it would have done better.  An average vote of 5.0 is nothing to complain about in my mind.  It is a good idea.  Like I said earlier a little better focus would go a long way here.  Also if you would have gotten new crayons then it would have done a lot better also.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this challenge scuds, but I would say you need better focus.  If you would have gotten all the crayons in focus then it would have done better.  An average vote of 5.0 is nothing to complain about in my mind.  It is a good idea.  Like I said earlier a little better focus would go a long way here.  Also if you would have gotten new crayons then it would have done a lot better also.', '2005-03-28 09:53:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1253858, 157886, 24846, '<td valign="top">I didn''t partcipate or vote in this challenge but always make a point to peruse the top 100. You are one of the most creative people on this site and I admire your work, especially the technical effort. I love this underrated shot! I hope you have some outtakes at your website...</td>', 'I didn''t partcipate or vote in this challenge but always make a point to peruse the top 100. You are one of the most creative people on this site and I admire your work, especially the technical effort. I love this underrated shot! I hope you have some outtakes at your website...', '2005-03-28 10:18:19.000000', NULL, 0),
