(1254665, 156635, 17507, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work, man! You do credit to our camera. Great use of leading lines, and the lighting and color are spot on. You are quickly making a reputation for yourself as a long-exposure/night photographer.<br/> <br/>V1 POWER!!</td>', 'Beautiful work, man! You do credit to our camera. Great use of leading lines, and the lighting and color are spot on. You are quickly making a reputation for yourself as a long-exposure/night photographer. V1 POWER!!', '2005-03-28 17:31:30.000000', NULL, 0),
