(1255797, 158075, 35560, '<td valign="top">My daughter goes to school opposite this place (UCSD) I have taken some great shots of the hanggliders but nothing like this!  Seems like this a hangout for Rebel/300D users!  I''m especially glad to note that you used the kit lens for this picture - there is so much controversy over this lens'' capabilities - I keep thinking I need to spend more money on L lenses, but this winning picture has changed my mind...</td>', 'My daughter goes to school opposite this place (UCSD) I have taken some great shots of the hanggliders but nothing like this!  Seems like this a hangout for Rebel/300D users!  I''m especially glad to note that you used the kit lens for this picture - there is so much controversy over this lens'' capabilities - I keep thinking I need to spend more money on L lenses, but this winning picture has changed my mind...', '2005-03-29 05:28:13.000000', NULL, 0),
