(1256253, 157270, 20395, '<td valign="top">I''ll I can say is, "...............................?" <br/> <br/>There really was no sneaky idea behind the photo, nor any kind of, well, anything. I like the shallow DOF, I needed a picture for my website, there happened to be a stock challenge. I don''t get why it did so poorly, but I can''t say I get why people are so jazzed about it either, not that I''m complaining mind you ;-). <br/> <br/>Thanks for the votes and the comments!<br/>Amanda</td>', 'I''ll I can say is, "...............................?"  There really was no sneaky idea behind the photo, nor any kind of, well, anything. I like the shallow DOF, I needed a picture for my website, there happened to be a stock challenge. I don''t get why it did so poorly, but I can''t say I get why people are so jazzed about it either, not that I''m complaining mind you ;-).  Thanks for the votes and the comments!Amanda', '2005-03-29 11:36:07.000000', NULL, 0),
