(1257233, 158065, 23458, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a bit of a disappointing result. This was, as my initial comments reflected, just about as close to prototypical stock material as anything in this challenge. It''s the type of image that all sorts of corporate types / web designers could make use of. The background is a little distracting I suppose, but other than that I can''t make out why this didn''t score well into the sixes (especially considering the number of six + scores there were in this challenge). That''s what you get for not shooting a landscape I guess :).</td>', 'Wow, this is a bit of a disappointing result. This was, as my initial comments reflected, just about as close to prototypical stock material as anything in this challenge. It''s the type of image that all sorts of corporate types / web designers could make use of. The background is a little distracting I suppose, but other than that I can''t make out why this didn''t score well into the sixes (especially considering the number of six + scores there were in this challenge). That''s what you get for not shooting a landscape I guess :).', '2005-03-29 21:39:54.000000', NULL, 0),
